// The research module of the OpenZone admin window -- its own pbo and its own layout, because a server without the research mod never loads this file and the core must not know the pane exists. OZL_VppPane.OnCreate builds it under M_SUB_WIDGET and registers it eight times with RegisterPage(research, ...): the rail's pages Overview, Tree, Chains, Point types, Owners, Modules, Statics and Settings all show this one pane, and OnPaneShown switches the page inside it (VPP rework 2026-11-12, design 5.5). The shell moves the root into the content area and sizes it (vpp.content by default); the script reflows the rest (OnWindowResized). Since 2026-11-09 it is the research editor (docs/specs/2026-11-09-research-editor-vpp-design.md): one page per rail entry in RzPages (the script shows one) and the draft's action bar. Names the script resolves by string: every widget named Rz*, ResOwners, ResPicked, ResStatics, RzSummary, GrantType, GrantN, NodeId; ResHint is resolved by the core from the hint name handed to RegisterPage. Captions are stringtable keys of OpenZone_Research (UA original, EN).
